{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5num_vanishes_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5num_vanishes_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L117-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4num_vanishes_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4num_vanishes_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L114-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3num_vanishes_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3num_vanishes_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L109-L112","doc":"At `q = 1` the `L₃` numerator vanishes — the classical limit collapses the tail onto the\npure q-Gaussian. (Follows from `L3_factor`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5_factor","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L102-L105","doc":"**`L₅` carries `(q−1)⁴`** (order `e₅ = 4`) — the tail suppression deepens from `(q−1)²`\n(`m = 3, 4`) to `(q−1)⁴` (`m = 5`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5cof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5cof","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L96-L100","doc":"Cofactor of `L₅` after removing `(q−1)⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L5num","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L89-L94","doc":"Expanded numerator of `L₅` (degree 18, palindromic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4_factor","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L85-L87","doc":"**`L₄` carries `(q−1)²`** (order `e₄ = 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4cof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4cof","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L81-L83","doc":"Cofactor of `L₄` after removing `(q−1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L4num","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L76-L79","doc":"Expanded numerator of `L₄` (degree 10, palindromic). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3_factor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3_factor","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L72-L74","doc":"**`L₃` carries `(q−1)²`** (order `e₃ = 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3cof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3cof","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L69-L70","doc":"Cofactor of `L₃` after removing `(q−1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L3num","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L66-L67","doc":"Expanded numerator of `L₃` (degree 6). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L2_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L2_classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L59-L62","doc":"**Classical limit.** At `q = 1`, `L₂ = L2num/L2den = 2/4 = ½` — the `z²` coefficient of the\nclassical involution EGF `exp(x + x²/2)`. Stated division-free as `num(1) = 2 ∧ den(1) = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L2den","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L2den","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L56-L57","doc":"Denominator of `L₂`: `2q² + 2 = 2·Φ₄` (the `ζ₄` residue). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L2num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQGaussianHabiro.L2num","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingQGaussianHabiro.lean#L53-L54","doc":"Numerator of `L₂` (the q-Gaussian `z²`-coefficient): `−q² + 4q − 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}